WEBVTT

1
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:32,410
This is the fate of a true god of Xia Wei

2
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,550
And you are not even demigods

3
00:00:34,710 --> 00:00:36,150
In the eyes of gods and monsters

4
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:38,270
Not even qualified to be a snack

5
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:42,410
Times haven't changed

6
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:44,690
This place has always been a meat grinder.

7
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:48,010
The cracks in God’s injustice are widening every day

8
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:49,570
People are dying every day on the front line

9
00:00:49,850 --> 00:00:50,770
You have to remember

10
00:00:50,930 --> 00:00:52,090
We are god-shaped

11
00:00:52,210 --> 00:00:53,570
But we are warriors

12
00:00:55,120 --> 00:00:57,840
Know why federal universities

13
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,720
Are you only interested in the combat priesthood?
